ny contract was broken up or that anyone acted improperly; it may reflect market prices, fixed budgets or separate needs.\nWhat can be checked: in the linked contract files, what was bought in each case and on which dates, and whether several contracts meet a single need that could have been procured at once.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"plantilla","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["SxkLHGdh2cu7JOCXkOhcDg%3D%3D","oLl%2FA%2BPZeK1%2FR5QFTlaM4A%3D%3D","9aA43wNxgSmFlFRHfEzEaw%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-16"}}